t":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"dominikg","id":611613,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMTYxMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/611613?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dominikg","html_url":"https://github.com/dominikg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dominikg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dominikg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dominikg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dominikg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dominikg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dominikg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dominikg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dominikg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dominikg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sveltejs/kit/issues/comments/894188450","html_url":"https://github.com/sveltejs/kit/issues/2118#issuecomment-894188450","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sveltejs/kit/issues/2118","id":894188450,"node_id":"IC_kwDOEiPr8c41TDui","user":{"login":"Conduitry","id":16696352,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2Njk2MzUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16696352?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Conduitry","html_url":"https://github.com/Conduitry","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Conduitry/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Conduitry/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Conduitry/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Conduitry/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Conduitry/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Conduitry/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Conduitry/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Conduitry/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Conduitry/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-08-06T11:12:57Z","updated_at":"2021-08-06T11:12:57Z","body":"Hm. I can see why that'd be helpful, but it still makes me a bit uncomfortable. Where would this rewriting happen? Just for redirects generated by `load`? For redirects generated by other endpoint functions? If you have a `handle` hook that calls `resolve`, would `resolve` return the already rewritten 301->302? Or would SvelteKit intervene and rewrite 301->302 in the response returned by `handle`?\r\n\r\nA much easier solution would be to update the HN example to use different HTTP codes in dev and prod - or even to just always use a 302.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sveltejs/kit/issues/comments/894188450/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"Conduitry","id":16696352,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2Njk2MzUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16696352?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Conduitry","html_url":"https://github.com/Conduitry","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Conduitry/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Conduitry/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Conduitry/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Conduitry/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Conduitry/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Conduitry/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Conduitry/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Conduitry/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Conduitry/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sveltejs/kit/issues/comments/894203063","html_url":"https://github.com/sveltejs/kit/issues/2118#issuecomment-894203063","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sveltejs/kit/issues/2118","id":894203063,"node_id":"IC_kwDOEiPr8c41THS3","user":{"login":"dominikg","id":611613,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMTYxMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/611613?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dominikg","html_url":"https://github.com/dominikg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dominikg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dominikg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dominikg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dominikg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dominikg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dominikg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dominikg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dominikg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dominikg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-08-06T11:43:35Z","updated_at":"2021-08-06T11:43:35Z","body":"for this concrete example, yes. just using 302 instead of 301 works. \r\n\r\nBut this is just one case of the general \"redirects during dev\" story. As the code responsible for the redirects might change the target any time during dev, and the devserver origin is very commonly shared (localhost:3000), we should avoid polluting the browser cache of that origin. (similar problem can happen with service-workers)\r\n\r\nNot sure what the best way to implement this would be, most likely a dev-only middleware at the far end of the chain swapping out the response code from 301 to 302?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sveltejs/kit/issues/comments/894203063/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"dominikg","id":611613,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMTYxMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/611613?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dominikg","html_url":"https://github.com/dominikg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dominikg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dominikg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dominikg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dominikg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dominikg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dominikg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dominikg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dominikg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dominikg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sveltejs/kit/issues/comments/894209160","html_url":"https://github.com/sveltejs/kit/issues/2118#issuecomment-894209160","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sveltejs/kit/issues/2118","id":894209160,"node_id":"IC_kwDOEiPr8c41TIyI","user":{"login":"Conduitry","id":16696352,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2Njk2MzUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16696352?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Conduitry","html_url":"https://github.com/Conduitry","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Conduitry/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Conduitry/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Conduitry/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Conduitry/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Conduitry/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Conduitry/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Conduitry/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Conduitry/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Conduitry/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-08-06T11:56:47Z","updated_at":"2021-08-06T11:56:47Z","body":"Would you also think that, after we get the response from the `handle` hook, we should rewrite any `cache-control` headers as well?\r\n\r\nProtecting users from themselves isn't an inherently bad goal, but I'm just worried about doing so in a way that secretly rewrites their responses after the point they have the ability to do anything about it.\r\n\r\nDo we want this to be configurable? Do we want to warn the users in any way when we've done something like this? These were the questions I was trying to avoid for now. We don't need any more scope creep on SvelteKit 1.0, and the simplest and least controversial way to address this specific issue is to change the HN project.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sveltejs/kit/issues/comments/894209160/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"Conduitry","id":16696352,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2Njk2MzUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16696352?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Conduitry","html_url":"https://github.com/Conduitry","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Conduitry/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Conduitry/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Conduitry/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https: